---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: "help_of(&format!(\"{line} -h\"))"
---
Work with board templates.

USAGE
  holst template <command> [flags]

COMMANDS
  ls:          List templates or their categories
  show:        Show a template's content
  create:      Save a board or a part of it as a template
  edit:        Replace a template's body
  rm:          Delete a template for good

EXAMPLES
  $ holst tpl ls --view standard --category strategic-planning
  $ holst tpl create "Roadmap" "Quarter plan" --for workspace
